{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-11","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：无理线段与五边形与直径","englishTitle":"If in a circle which has its diameter rational an equilateral pentagon be inscribed, the side of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor.","book":13,"number":11,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.11","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.11/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":11,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","contentId":"euclid-13-11","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fce3b118659f5757915555313aa5c6945fd1dcc4843899e722f2abeb0023d7aa","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-11.statement","euclid-13-11.proof.1","euclid-13-11.construction.1","euclid-13-11.proof.2","euclid-13-11.proof.3","euclid-13-11.proof.4","euclid-13-11.proof.5","euclid-13-11.proof.6","euclid-13-11.proof.7","euclid-13-11.proof.8","euclid-13-11.proof.9","euclid-13-11.proof.10","euclid-13-11.proof.11","euclid-13-11.proof.12","euclid-13-11.proof.13","euclid-13-11.proof.14","euclid-13-11.proof.15","euclid-13-11.proof.16","euclid-13-11.proof.17","euclid-13-11.proof.18","euclid-13-11.proof.19","euclid-13-11.proof.20","euclid-13-11.proof.21","euclid-13-11.construction.2","euclid-13-11.proof.22","euclid-13-11.proof.23","euclid-13-11.proof.24","euclid-13-11.proof.25","euclid-13-11.proof.26","euclid-13-11.proof.27","euclid-13-11.proof.28","euclid-13-11.conclusion","euclid-13-11.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-11.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"152c529a0f3e72eead38ba6355eedc41bcff88dd187f96e7ee2535a3cd20e168","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If in a circle which has its diameter rational an equilateral pentagon be inscribed, the side of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在直径为有理的圆形中刻上等边的五角形,则五角形的侧面为无理线段,称为次要的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":1,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1ea3c422d51e85356276927c9693d890747ddc63c4cdabb73bec45b4acc16fc7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For in the circle ABCDE which has its diameter rational let the equilateral pentagon ABCDE be inscribed; I say that the side of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为在直径为有理的ABCDE圆中,允许对等的五边形ABCDE刻上;我说五边形是无理线段称为次要的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cc9b0f39053c55081513c0c1d1c51ce520dd825c7072990c2e443129c59141d9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the centre of the circle, the point F, be taken, let AF, FB be joined and carried through to the points, G, H, let AC be joined, and let FK be made a fourth part of AF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将圆的中心,即F点,连接到AF点,FB点,然后传送到各点,G点,H点,连接到AC点,FK点,然后将FK点作为AF点的第四部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a8943c21344932dfd8690a04aceb828456d73c66f616ec7abd8875c002e1a6ba","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now AF is rational; therefore FK is also rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在AF是有理,因此FK也是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d58869d4b23b4dbe4cef1e8cd0762af0be110782c2fc629ef40a699aab590e64","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BF is also rational; therefore the whole BK is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BF也是有理,因此整个BK是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f5a7ba98ff2fdcea649ccd3f87de6982370215edee1ac195c9c84852297cc6ff","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the circumference ACG is equal to the circumference ADG, and in them ABC is equal to AED, therefore the remainder CG is equal to the remainder GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于环形ACG等于环形ADG,其中ABC等于AED,因此其余CG等于其余GD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38590bc58b7953b709c6b27f34fd36340993db5afecb2301053fad63ded34845","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, if we join AD, we conclude that the angles at L are right, and CD is double of CL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果我们连接到AD, 我们的结论是,L的该角是直角, CD是CL的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"254c0318473441b4690ff0329fff0767dae79af814255d69f7b29b444e843706","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason the angles at M are also right, and AC is double of CM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,M时的角度也是正确的,AC时是CM时的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"17ef9ec6c0115bc652cb165269350e8e95f01953ca57f75b7442db786f4e2dd2","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the angle ALC is equal to the angle AMF, and the angle LAC is common to the two triangles ACL and AMF, therefore the remaining angle ACL is equal to the remaining angle MFA; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle ACL is equiangular with the triangle AMF; therefore, proportionally, as LC is to CA, so is MF to FA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,ALC角等于AMF角,LAC角与两个三角形ACL和AMF相同,因此,其余ACL角等于其余角MFA;因此,ACL三角形与AMF三角形以等角形形形形形形形形形形色色;因此,LC比CA比MF比FA；LC 与 CA 之比等于 MF 与 FA 之比。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"24bfb595f3df58d1dd81a80054a549c06ec911126495bff1fb3dc9f770bd979d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the doubles of the antecedents may be taken; therefore, as the double of LC is to CA, so is the double of MF to FA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"并且可以使用前身的双倍;因此,LC比CA的双倍比等于MF比FA的双倍比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f0830a7c743b2a5c3eabf1ff2da00e73039e6640a6fccecf806d162e6bcf93d6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the double of MF is to FA, so is MF to the half of FA; therefore also, as the double of LC is to CA, so is MF to the half of FA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,MF比FA的两倍比等于MF比FA的一半;因此,LC比CA的两倍比等于MF比FA的一半。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d01e906357763cfe88f17b59a2ac0ace1a7f639afe7136821d24c84ffc611023","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the halves of the consequents may be taken; therefore, as the double of LC is to the half of CA, so is MF to the fourth of FA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此可以得出一半的结果;因此,LC比CA之半数的比等于MF比FA之四的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a68dc6c617deb8e2f5ec346926449cbbe0ba2b7bbea9e4db1027a22d23c9c458","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DC is double of LC, CM is half of CA, and FK a fourth part of FA; therefore, as DC is to CM, so is MF to FK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DC是LC,CM是CA的一半,FK是FA的第四半,是DC的两倍;因此,DC对CM的比等于MF对FK的比；DC 与 CM 之比等于 MF 与 FK 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3f3d4346c95228ab0b030c8d5b8948830ae585c61d0dfd6f0cac05fd4a92f9f8","citations":["euclid-5-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Componendo also, as the sum of DC, CM is to CM, so is MK to KF; [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)] therefore also, as the square on the sum of DC, CM is to the square on CM, so is the square on MK to the square on KF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DC,CM,CM,CM,CM,MK,KF;因此,DC,CM,正方形,CM,正方形,CM,正方形,CM,正方形,KF。 [[V. 18](/principles/euclid-5-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"14a855a460977c772ca1b7e29b61f17c52c2b95cb3fc590481460ceada728b96","citations":["euclid-13-8","euclid-13-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And since, when the straight line subtending two sides of the pentagon, as AC, is cut in extreme and mean ratio, the greater segment is equal to the side of the pentagon, that is, to DC, [[XIII. 8](/principles/euclid-13-8)] while the square on the greater segment added to the half of the whole is five times the square on the half of the whole, [[XIII. 1](/principles/euclid-13-1)] and CM is half of the whole AC, therefore the square on DC, CM taken as one straight line is five times the square on CM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于五角形两侧的直线分线为AC,黄金分割, 较大的数量部分等于五角形的一面,即DC, 而大数量部分中增加的总量部分为整个部分的5倍于正方形, 整个部分的5倍于黄金分割, CM是整个部分的2倍, 因此, DC, CM 以一线形式被作为一条直线的正方形, 是CM的5倍于正方形。 [[XIII. 8](/principles/euclid-13-8)] [[XIII. 1](/principles/euclid-13-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82d7d5d2bc7c8012fdc675905bf5f555a960146aa273dd5cf1ac9d77c69cd667","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was proved that, as the square on DC, CM taken as one straight line is to the square on CM, so is the square on MK to the square on KF; therefore the square on MK is five times the square on KF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但事实证明,DC对正方形对CM对正方形对CM对正方形的比相当于MK对DC对正方形的比;因此,MK对正方形对KF是正方形对正方形的比的五倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b078fa033cb7f7c2eec78810cfc249c3be5b7cdd66da20ff53baec7733592248","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on KF is rational, for the diameter is rational; therefore the square on MK is also rational; therefore MK is rational"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但KF的正方形是有理,直径是有理;因此MK的正方形也是有理;因此MK是有理"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3153dee95677e23f1236087b13e6f2b7f7ef7447b26d3fd528538cccaf27c348","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since BF is quadruple of FK, therefore BK is five times KF; therefore the square on BK is twenty-five times the square on KF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BF是FK的三倍,BK是KF的5倍,BK是BF的25倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fafc26e4b3a610198586f435d90d148ee5af3bd110458a933cb7b92eb088ab7","citations":["euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on MK is five times the square on KF; therefore the square on BK is five times the square on KM; therefore the square on BK has not to the square on KM the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BK is incommensurable in length with KM. [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,MK的正方形是KF的正方形的5倍;因此,BK的正方形是KM的正方形的5倍;因此,BK的正方形与KM的正方形的比例相比,没有达到平方数与平方数的比例;因此,BK的KM是不可公度。 [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fffc0e98205ee43f8e1396611ff3aaba3026d1368e76b3a1b94c833fbf0ad10b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And each of them is rational."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每一个是有理。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"95ec54d8a30e3ce924015cb497ca7999bd3a25eef256a0a029bf0fe0249346a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore BK, KM are rational straight lines commensurable in square only."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BK,KM是有理线段 平方可公度而长度不可公度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"98105858b8a3c1bc8686932f47485e8bf0595082a1722318c2e936f76a996515","citations":["euclid-10-73"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, if from a rational straight line there be subtracted a rational straight line which is commensurable with the whole in square only, the remainder is irrational, namely an apotome; therefore MB is an apotome and MK the annex to it. [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,如果从有理线段减去有理线段,即可公度,整个为正方形,则其余为无理,即截差无理线段;因此,MB是截差无理线段,MK是附件。 [[X. 73](/principles/euclid-10-73)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bf12cd55a08d85bc69346b1342fec3961b69e4141ad4fa41c5cb7db9fda166ee","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that MB is also a fourth apotome."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"接下来我说,MB也是第四个截差无理线段。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":23,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7f265ef2e296d4956b55004fe9d3bf0a6b56a3b68312b1691db69819bb4a8f65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the square on N be equal to that by which the square on BK is greater than the square on KM; therefore the square on BK is greater than the square on KM by the square on N."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"N比BK比正方形比KM比正方形相等;因此,BK比正方形比KM比正方形比正方形比N比正方形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":24,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3244a3c4d515da105c74ce663a570ddf9b8ff29cceb3d1f5dcf3e9895a1ca2e5","citations":["euclid-10-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since KF is commensurable with FB, componendo also, KB is commensurable with FB. [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有KF是可公度,FB,KB是可公度,FB。 [[X. 15](/principles/euclid-10-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c46360111a72d31066bb6bc3585c2184bfad72f01748c9403112ea2404231fa7","citations":["euclid-10-12"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But BF is commensurable with BH; therefore BK is also commensurable with BH. [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BF是可公度,BH,BK也是可公度,BH。 [[X. 12](/principles/euclid-10-12)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c5526750aeac62d09f07cf2e61b3c696da3d06c24b37f40c26db02325def849","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the square on BK is five times the square on KM, therefore the square on BK has to the square on KM the ratio which 5 has to 1."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BK的正方形是KM的正方形的5倍 所以BK的正方形必须达到KM的正方形,5必须达到1的比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5b234d8689392d5d81ef22eca267ad18e4bbb4726e457dae4d5714a0e6fdec0","citations":["euclid-5-19","euclid-10-9"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, convertendo, the square on BK has to the square on N the ratio which 5 has to 4 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)], and this is not the ratio which a square number has to a square number; therefore BK is incommensurable with N; [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)] therefore the square on BK is greater than the square on KM by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BK."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BK的正方形比N的比例为正方形,5比4,而平方数比平方数比平方数,BK比N,BK比不可公度比正方形比KM比正方形比不可公度比BK比不可公度比正方形比不可公度比BK。 [[V. 19, Por.](/principles/euclid-5-19)] [[X. 9](/principles/euclid-10-9)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"438d83938994420cdf87322a14e038f670dfa596450aa1b01dcbdc476be897dd","citations":["euclid-10-def-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then the square on the whole BK is greater than the square on the annex KM by the square on a straight line incommensurable with BK, and the whole BK is commensurable with the rational straight line, BH, set out, therefore MB is a fourth apotome. [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,整个BK正方形比附件KM正方形多,在不可公度直线上比不可公度直线BK直线多,整个BK全线比有理线段可公度,有理线段BH确定,因此MB是第四号截差无理线段。 [[X. Deff. III. 4](/principles/euclid-10-def-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"717cf12214fa0cc2a819992d00ffc9c35d0298f8abeac709f86f5c560e601424","citations":["euclid-10-94"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the rectangle contained by a rational straight line and a fourth apotome is irrational, and its square root is irrational, and is called minor. [[X. 94](/principles/euclid-10-94)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但由有理线段和第四截差无理线段组成的矩形是无理,正方形根是无理,被称为小号。 [[X. 94](/principles/euclid-10-94)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c26aab7b92473405ddff27277ee4a4ed5b7dd53916ab770d3e2a0da9533503af","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the square on AB is equal to the rectangle HB, BM, because, when AH is joined, the triangle ABH is equiangular with the triangle ABM, and, as HB is to BA, so is AB to BM."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是AB的正方形等于矩形、HB,BM,因为当AH连接时,三角ABH是同三角ABM的等角,HB比BA等于AB比BM；HB 与 BA 之比等于 AB 与 BM 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":31,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3ca665f2a72a2c999e4030901f20f73da7d62dd2efcb6606fb5a8019a2d27975","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the side AB of the pentagon is the irrational straight line called minor. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,五角大楼的AB是无理线段,称为未成年人,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-11.source","contentId":"euclid-13-11","revisionId":"euclid-13-11@raw-fce3b118659f5757","order":32,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8eed4b253d1738620f7b70504223ed4a6f0033542e1ff3bde02fe5f93d9d3e13","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.11/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.11\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-11:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-11","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-11.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.11","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.p